WEBVTT

01:34.830 --> 01:35.630
Exercise?

01:35.830 --> 01:36.880
Yeah.

01:36.880 --> 01:40.460
My arm's better now,
so I figure I'll walk home on days

01:40.460 --> 01:42.380
I don't have cram school
and you don't leave early.

01:42.380 --> 01:43.750
So...

01:44.710 --> 01:49.880
You'll walk with me every day?

01:50.130 --> 01:53.880
I-I mean, I basically already am...

01:53.880 --> 01:56.630
And double riding on my bike is too risky.

01:57.210 --> 01:59.080
She's a celebrity.

01:59.080 --> 02:01.790
There would be no coming back from getting in trouble.

02:01.960 --> 02:04.790
Oh! T-that reminds me!

02:04.790 --> 02:07.040
Hold this for a sec.

02:07.670 --> 02:10.580
Let's see... There's my udon point card...

02:10.960 --> 02:13.330
My test I got a 52 on...

02:13.330 --> 02:15.460
Money for a signboard for graduation...

02:17.580 --> 02:20.130
What is this bag?! A scrap-paper maker?!

02:22.710 --> 02:24.880
<b>It's Not Destiny-</b>

02:26.460 --> 02:31.130
<b>Prayer Isle</b>

02:26.460 --> 02:31.130
<b>Nationwide Special Admission Ticket</b>

02:27.290 --> 02:30.330
"Nationwide special admission ticket."

02:34.670 --> 02:36.210
It was a gift.

02:36.210 --> 02:40.330
The star, Yuko Kitamura is from the same agency.

02:40.330 --> 02:44.670
The movie's almost out of theaters,
s-so I gotta go today.

02:44.880 --> 02:46.000
Still looking for something?

02:47.670 --> 02:48.830
No...

02:52.500 --> 02:54.210
A love story, huh?

02:57.080 --> 02:58.630
Oh, uhh...

02:58.880 --> 03:02.880
Moeko gave me this ribbon for when
I go out somewhere after school.

03:10.130 --> 03:12.080
Your cardigan?

03:12.080 --> 03:13.880
Why am I wearing this?

03:14.380 --> 03:16.040
You look grown up this way.

03:16.040 --> 03:17.750
What's that supposed to mean?

03:23.500 --> 03:26.210
That's where my other ticket was!

03:26.210 --> 03:28.000
Oh, here's this back.

03:30.460 --> 03:32.000
You can have this.

03:32.380 --> 03:34.210
Oh, thanks...

03:35.250 --> 03:38.040
Don't. That's not what this means...

03:38.500 --> 03:40.250
S-see you.

03:41.000 --> 03:42.790
What do you want?

03:48.210 --> 03:50.460
W-wanna go?

03:50.460 --> 03:55.710
Or like, can I... go see it with you?

03:58.170 --> 04:00.000
Yeah! Of course!

04:07.250 --> 04:08.420
Sorry.

04:08.630 --> 04:09.580
For what?

04:10.130 --> 04:13.420
You know, for making you ask.

04:13.790 --> 04:14.880
It's fine.

04:16.040 --> 04:20.000
It feels like I really followed my heart.

04:20.630 --> 04:21.330
You like her.

04:22.080 --> 04:23.130
You want to go out with her.

04:23.130 --> 04:25.290
Careful! There are always traps!

04:27.210 --> 04:28.580
I-it's nothing.

04:28.580 --> 04:31.290
My own heart is fighting against itself...

04:33.540 --> 04:36.710
<b>Chinese</b>

04:33.540 --> 04:36.710
<b>Noodles</b>

04:33.670 --> 04:35.710
You should unbutton it.

04:38.500 --> 04:43.040
I got us out of double riding,
but it still feels like we're doing something bad.

04:44.170 --> 04:45.500
Out here like this...

04:45.500 --> 04:47.080
We still have time before it starts.
We're like high schoolers.<b></b>

04:47.080 --> 04:48.920
It's like we just skipped a few grades.

04:49.500 --> 04:52.540
If I run into anyone I know out here I'll just explode.

04:52.540 --> 04:54.250
They'd think I'm some big show off.

04:54.500 --> 04:57.420
Oh, look! Let's get something to eat first.

04:57.880 --> 05:00.250
Okay, time to go stealth mode.

05:00.250 --> 05:01.750
Snake-like...

05:01.750 --> 05:03.080
Excuse me!

05:03.080 --> 05:04.500
Hi! What can I get for y-

05:05.750 --> 05:06.750
Aft...

05:07.130 --> 05:08.250
Aft...?

05:08.920 --> 05:11.460
An after school date?!

05:11.460 --> 05:15.830
N-no! No! We're just like, going to see a movie.

05:12.000 --> 05:13.710
<b>Entrance</b>

05:12.000 --> 05:13.710
<b>Takeout Window</b>

05:15.830 --> 05:17.380
Sounds like YES to me.

05:18.750 --> 05:20.880
You work here?

05:20.880 --> 05:22.830
Heh. Yeah...

05:22.830 --> 05:24.130
You ready to order?

05:24.380 --> 05:26.040
Oh, I think we'll actually eat inside.

05:26.040 --> 05:26.880
Hang on...
Oh, I think we'll actually eat inside.<b></b>

05:26.880 --> 05:29.040
Just hang on a second, now!

05:31.040 --> 05:33.630
This is just me talking to myself, okay?

05:33.630 --> 05:34.210
What...?

05:34.790 --> 05:41.540
Even if I were to win the heart of some Arabian oil
prince and win myself wealth and power...

05:41.540 --> 05:43.880
There is one thing I would never have...

05:43.880 --> 05:45.210
And that is...

05:45.630 --> 05:48.290
An after school date in my school uniform!

05:49.000 --> 05:51.170
You chew on that thought.

05:51.170 --> 05:54.080
Keep this up and I'll give you a one-star review.

05:54.920 --> 05:58.290
I think it's okay to wear your uniform
on a date as an adult, too!

05:58.290 --> 06:00.000
Don't punch back.

06:02.830 --> 06:06.290
I-Is this a date?

06:06.290 --> 06:08.040
Doesn't that need more time?

06:09.920 --> 06:11.670
I think she's in trouble...

06:11.670 --> 06:12.920
Don't stare.

06:13.290 --> 06:17.000
She used to practice at home every
day when she started, y'know.

06:17.460 --> 06:20.250
Yeah? That's commitment.

06:20.500 --> 06:22.500
I mean, it's her job.

06:25.580 --> 06:26.830
Eat up!

06:26.830 --> 06:30.830
Be insatiable and never let 'em dish
out more than you can consume!

06:30.830 --> 06:31.580
Okay!

06:31.580 --> 06:32.500
Get lost!

06:33.170 --> 06:36.540
Hey, look who's trying to look cool now.

06:36.000 --> 06:48.210
<b>DOUDAKO</b>

06:36.000 --> 06:48.210
<b>Takoyaki</b>

06:36.000 --> 06:48.210
<b>Now Hiring</b>

06:36.960 --> 06:38.330
Enough already!

06:38.330 --> 06:39.420
Okay, okay!

06:39.710 --> 06:42.670
Takoyaki isn't really my thing, to be honest.

06:42.670 --> 06:44.790
What? You picked this place!

06:44.790 --> 06:46.750
I mean, I do like it...

06:46.750 --> 06:48.170
Make up your mind already.

06:51.710 --> 06:53.750
Ack! Sorry!

06:54.330 --> 06:56.040
I'm just bad at eating them...

06:59.920 --> 07:01.380
Ifs fo hard!

07:01.380 --> 07:03.750
Don't stuff the whole thing in your mouth, then!

07:03.750 --> 07:06.790
Sorry for the wait. Here are your drinks!

07:09.080 --> 07:11.040
Now who's the one staring?

07:11.040 --> 07:13.330
What?! No, it's just...

07:13.750 --> 07:17.630
I've never really seen someone close to me at work.

07:17.630 --> 07:19.250
Just thought she sure is working hard.

07:19.920 --> 07:21.130
Yeah...?

07:21.880 --> 07:22.710
Huh?

07:23.880 --> 07:28.290
I have a photo shoot next Sunday.
For a magazine.

07:28.540 --> 07:29.250
Huh?

07:29.830 --> 07:33.210
You could come see me, if you want.

07:34.380 --> 07:36.540
S-see her at work?

07:37.830 --> 07:39.380
I-I'd just be in the way.

07:39.380 --> 07:42.080
It's outside, so it's fine. I think.

07:43.210 --> 07:45.210
I'll go, if I can.

07:45.210 --> 07:47.170
That means you won't.

07:47.750 --> 07:49.960
Only when adults say it.

07:50.170 --> 07:51.460
So...?

07:52.040 --> 07:54.460
I don't mind going...

07:54.460 --> 07:55.960
I'm definitely interested.

07:55.960 --> 07:57.040
But still...

07:57.210 --> 07:58.540
Yay!

07:59.920 --> 08:02.630
Is this one mine?

08:03.170 --> 08:04.210
It is.

08:04.580 --> 08:06.540
Heh, thanks!

08:06.920 --> 08:07.960
Wait!

08:08.210 --> 08:10.080
You should cool the inside first.

08:10.080 --> 08:11.130
You do it.

08:11.130 --> 08:12.250
Seriously?

08:12.960 --> 08:15.040
First you split it open like this...

08:18.170 --> 08:19.170
Excuse me!

08:19.170 --> 08:20.170
G-go ahead.

08:20.170 --> 08:21.170
Be right with you!

08:25.040 --> 08:26.960
What am I even doing?

08:32.670 --> 08:33.380
Wait...

08:33.380 --> 08:34.080
Okay, one cheese mentaiko and one spring onion.

08:34.080 --> 08:34.960
Okay, one cheese mentaiko and one spring onion.
Really...?<b></b>

08:34.960 --> 08:37.250
Okay, one cheese mentaiko and one spring onion.

08:49.460 --> 08:52.670
Your bill? C'mon. I got it covered.

08:52.670 --> 08:53.880
Really? But...

08:54.290 --> 08:55.500
You sure?

08:55.880 --> 08:57.880
Cut me a little slack.

08:58.080 --> 09:02.330
<b>Trainee</b>

08:58.080 --> 09:02.330
<b>J. Ichoku</b>

08:58.090 --> 09:00.330
You're getting yelled at by the newbie?!

09:00.330 --> 09:02.040
Shut up and scram!

09:04.880 --> 09:06.630
They call me Popcorn Man!

09:07.000 --> 09:08.290
Uhh, hi.

09:08.710 --> 09:11.130
That thing's huge. They serve Yamada-size?

09:11.130 --> 09:12.920
We're gonna share!

09:13.170 --> 09:14.210
<b>Popcorn Set</b>

09:13.170 --> 09:14.210
<b>Drink M + Popcorn M</b>

09:13.790 --> 09:15.170
A date...

09:14.210 --> 09:15.380
<b>Popcorn Pair Set</b>

09:14.210 --> 09:15.380
<b>Drink M x 2 + Popcorn L</b>

09:14.210 --> 09:15.380
<b>(Salt, Caramel, Salt & Caramel)</b>

09:15.500 --> 09:18.920
If going out to do something alone
with a girl is what people call a date,

09:18.920 --> 09:20.380
then I guess this is one.

09:21.000 --> 09:25.460
Assuming this is a date,
kinda feels like going too far, though...

09:28.960 --> 09:29.880
Hey.

09:31.080 --> 09:32.460
Let's swap seats.

09:32.460 --> 09:33.210
Why?

09:35.790 --> 09:37.040
No reason.

09:39.210 --> 09:40.710
Do you watch a lot of movies?

09:40.710 --> 09:43.130
No, not at the theater, at least.

09:43.130 --> 09:45.420
And I fall asleep watching them at home.

09:45.420 --> 09:47.080
I'll wake you up if you do.

09:48.830 --> 09:52.920
You know, I read the book
the movie you're in is based on.

09:53.170 --> 09:55.330
No way! You remembered?

09:56.040 --> 09:58.290
It was already on my radar anyway.

09:58.630 --> 10:01.170
Your character isn't in the book, though.

10:01.540 --> 10:03.000
They aren't?

10:03.000 --> 10:03.830
You haven't read it?!

10:04.830 --> 10:08.710
I'm going to Hiroshima to film for that movie.

10:08.710 --> 10:10.880
Over spring break. For about a week.

10:10.880 --> 10:12.040
Yeah?

10:13.580 --> 10:16.540
This movie today is to help me study acting!

10:17.040 --> 10:20.880
Yuko Kitamura is the actress
I want to be like most, you know!

10:21.080 --> 10:24.080
The cool roles, the funny ones...
She's amazing at everything!

10:24.080 --> 10:27.750
Guess even Yamada talks fast when
it's about something she likes.

10:29.290 --> 10:30.710
This feeling I get

10:30.710 --> 10:31.630
We ask that you please turn your mobile phones off during the film.
This feeling I get<b></b>

10:31.630 --> 10:34.750
We ask that you please turn your mobile phones off during the film.
when it comes to her work is hard to describe...<b></b>

10:34.750 --> 10:36.040
We ask that you please turn your mobile phones off during the film.

10:36.040 --> 10:38.540
The movie will begin momentarily...

10:38.790 --> 10:41.710
Want me to tell mom you'll be out late?

10:41.920 --> 10:42.960
Shut your face!

10:45.580 --> 10:49.080
This reminds me of another movie.

10:49.420 --> 10:52.580
Oh no. I might be the werewolf.

10:52.920 --> 10:56.130
"Neo Werewolf Last Final 2"

10:56.460 --> 11:00.960
A movie with Lemonzaka or
whatever from half a year ago.

11:01.210 --> 11:03.250
Why did I watch it?

11:03.250 --> 11:05.380
Because the credits listed "Anna Akino,"

11:05.380 --> 11:07.750
which meant Yamada was in it.

11:08.250 --> 11:10.790
Shoot! Where was I? Uhh...

11:10.790 --> 11:12.170
I'm going home...

11:12.170 --> 11:14.630
What a bunch of losers. Acting all scared.

11:15.080 --> 11:19.170
She played some random mean
girl who died super early on.

11:19.670 --> 11:24.040
But, you could see the difference
between her and an amateur clear as day.

11:25.130 --> 11:27.670
She's an actress.

11:28.040 --> 11:28.750
Wake up.

11:30.040 --> 11:31.420
I wasn't sleeping.

11:32.670 --> 11:34.540
A k-kiss scene?!

11:35.130 --> 11:36.960
And a long one!

11:37.210 --> 11:38.670
This is so awkward...

11:39.040 --> 11:39.880
Bwha...?

11:44.420 --> 11:48.380
Yamada sees the world through different eyes.

11:49.460 --> 11:51.460
I'm always reminded of that fact.

11:51.460 --> 11:52.830
And scared by it...

11:53.750 --> 11:54.500
But, even still...

11:54.500 --> 11:56.290
Their love didn't work out...

11:58.630 --> 12:02.040
But, breakups don't always have to be bad.

12:02.040 --> 12:05.170
And Yuko Kitamura was so pretty!

12:07.130 --> 12:08.290
Oh, sorry.

12:08.290 --> 12:09.580
For what?

12:10.040 --> 12:13.500
Just feels like it probably wasn't your type of movie.

12:14.380 --> 12:16.750
But, even still...

12:17.000 --> 12:20.710
I've been rambling on all day about stuff I like.

12:21.170 --> 12:26.500
Even still, seeing her rave about things
I'll never know is a beauty to behold.

12:26.790 --> 12:27.670
I wanna know...

12:27.880 --> 12:28.630
Huh?

12:29.540 --> 12:33.830
I wanna know you better...

12:39.250 --> 12:42.960
I, uhh, just never knew you
were so into studying this stuff...

12:42.960 --> 12:46.710
Oh, yeah. I learned a lot from that movie.

12:47.670 --> 12:49.500
Outside of work, too...

12:51.380 --> 12:54.210
<b>Note: The characters are playing shiritori, a word chain game.</b>

12:51.380 --> 12:54.210
<b>Whoever uses a word that ends in "n" loses.</b>

12:51.670 --> 12:52.830
<i>Apple.</i>

12:53.040 --> 12:54.000
<i>Eraser.</i>

12:54.540 --> 12:55.960
<i>Ramen Rou.</i>

12:56.250 --> 12:57.250
<i>Uniform.</i>

12:57.250 --> 12:58.750
<i>Milk tea.</i>

12:58.750 --> 13:00.130
<i>Abacus.</i>

13:00.130 --> 13:01.540
<i>Stew.</i>

13:01.880 --> 13:02.920
<i>Worm.</i>

13:02.920 --> 13:04.330
<i>Matsutake.</i>

13:04.330 --> 13:05.500
<i>Emblem.</i>

13:05.790 --> 13:07.790
<i>M... M...</i>

13:09.210 --> 13:10.420
<i>Merci!</i>

13:10.750 --> 13:11.750
<i>It's nothin'...</i>

13:12.040 --> 13:13.210
Yay!

13:13.210 --> 13:14.130
I lost...

13:14.130 --> 13:15.540
I win!

13:15.540 --> 13:17.290
I'm the winner!

13:19.710 --> 13:20.670
Hey.

13:20.670 --> 13:21.790
Hey!

13:24.670 --> 13:27.380
Do I look weird? In this outfit?

13:27.920 --> 13:30.170
Nope. You look good.

13:30.170 --> 13:31.250
Thanks.

13:34.130 --> 13:35.250
Talk about early!

13:38.080 --> 13:39.330
<b>8AM at Ebisu tomorrow</b>

13:38.080 --> 13:39.330
<b>ok</b>

13:38.090 --> 13:41.000
I'm gonna get a look at Yamada at work today.

13:38.090 --> 13:39.330
<b>Today</b>

13:38.090 --> 13:39.330
<b>You up?</b>

13:38.090 --> 13:39.330
<b>I'm up</b>

13:38.090 --> 13:39.330
<b>I'm proud</b>

13:38.090 --> 13:39.330
<b>Just got to Ebisu</b>

13:39.330 --> 13:40.210
<b>Yay</b>

13:40.210 --> 13:41.000
<b>I'm nervous</b>

13:41.630 --> 13:45.420
I took her at her word that it was okay to come.

13:45.420 --> 13:47.080
But is it really?

13:47.080 --> 13:48.500
Is this weird?

13:48.500 --> 13:51.380
Oh, right. Times like these...

13:51.710 --> 13:53.170
<b>As seen on TV</b>

13:51.710 --> 13:53.170
<b>Woof-woof Cake</b>

13:53.710 --> 13:56.920
...call for little gifts, I think?

13:56.920 --> 13:59.420
If it's weird, I just won't give it to her.

14:00.380 --> 14:01.960
Thank you!

14:03.130 --> 14:06.250
That's Sunday morning for you. There's no one here!

14:06.250 --> 14:08.000
I stick out like a sore thumb!

14:08.580 --> 14:11.920
I wanted to blend in with the crowd while I watched!

14:11.920 --> 14:12.880
Hmm?

14:24.830 --> 14:25.920
Oh!

14:28.540 --> 14:30.750
You're looking cute today, Anna.

14:31.080 --> 14:33.290
What? I always do!

14:33.790 --> 14:38.380
I knew all along, but this really is what her work is like...

14:38.380 --> 14:43.210
Everyone's so grown up. So stylish. So hard at work.

14:43.210 --> 14:45.210
And Yamada is a part of it all.

14:46.290 --> 14:47.790
What am I even wearing?

14:48.130 --> 14:49.040
Wow!

14:49.040 --> 14:50.210
Macarons!

14:50.210 --> 14:51.540
For once you're done.

14:58.790 --> 14:59.670
What's wrong?

15:00.330 --> 15:05.080
All this just feels like child's play all of a sudden.

15:05.630 --> 15:08.880
You're the one who said you wanted to know her better.

15:09.380 --> 15:13.830
But, on second thought,
this has nothing to do with me.

15:13.830 --> 15:15.500
You don't need to run away.

15:15.500 --> 15:16.630
I'm not.

15:17.580 --> 15:21.080
Are your feelings, MY feelings, just "play"?

15:22.880 --> 15:23.750
Go aw-

15:30.080 --> 15:31.880
Wha...? Why...?

15:31.880 --> 15:34.960
I saw you running off.

15:34.960 --> 15:37.000
Aren't you working?

15:37.000 --> 15:39.920
It's fine. I told them I needed a bathroom break.

15:40.750 --> 15:43.000
What's wrong? Do you feel sick?

15:43.000 --> 15:43.790
No...

15:43.790 --> 15:47.080
It's nothing. Now go back.

15:48.170 --> 15:49.460
I'm sorry.

15:49.460 --> 15:50.670
For what?

15:51.210 --> 15:54.130
This probably isn't fun, huh?

15:54.130 --> 15:57.380
Work isn't about being fun or not, right?

15:57.380 --> 15:59.960
No? You think so?

16:01.540 --> 16:03.330
Remember what I told you?

16:03.330 --> 16:07.580
About how I never got good at the things I practiced?

16:07.580 --> 16:09.170
And always quit?

16:09.710 --> 16:11.580
I felt the same way about this job...

16:11.920 --> 16:12.750
What...?

16:12.750 --> 16:20.460
There are so many girls who are cuter,
prettier, better actors, and funnier than me.

16:20.460 --> 16:23.630
I get in trouble every day. It's exhausting.

16:23.880 --> 16:26.500
I didn't really know why I kept at it.

16:28.880 --> 16:31.420
But, then you made me see.

16:32.170 --> 16:34.830
You like what you do, huh?

16:35.830 --> 16:38.210
I was so happy.

16:50.750 --> 16:56.290
Yamada's happy, so I should be, too.

16:56.630 --> 16:58.130
So why does this hurt so much?

16:59.380 --> 17:01.920
If she doesn't go back...

17:02.170 --> 17:04.000
If she skips work...

17:04.380 --> 17:06.170
If she gets fired...

17:07.040 --> 17:09.170
If she...

17:12.000 --> 17:14.750
...went back to being just an ordinary junior high girl...

17:19.040 --> 17:19.750
Huh?

17:20.130 --> 17:20.880
Ichi-

17:21.630 --> 17:22.710
Where are we-?

17:23.710 --> 17:26.540
If she did. If that's all she was...

17:28.080 --> 17:29.830
I wouldn't have fallen for her like this!

17:36.380 --> 17:37.290
Took you long-

17:45.500 --> 17:47.330
What? Hey! Hey!

17:49.380 --> 17:51.630
What? Come on! They'll get the wrong idea!

17:51.630 --> 17:52.920
Well, now.

17:53.500 --> 17:56.920
You don't look like any ordinary friend.

17:57.420 --> 17:59.250
No... I...

17:59.250 --> 18:01.210
Who is this guy? Look at that build!

18:01.500 --> 18:02.960
And those terrifying eyes!

18:03.920 --> 18:05.080
This is my friend.

18:05.080 --> 18:07.000
I mean, this is Ichikawa!

18:08.750 --> 18:10.380
Oh, that one?

18:10.380 --> 18:11.500
Which one?

18:12.330 --> 18:13.920
Is that so?

18:14.670 --> 18:15.500
Here.

18:14.670 --> 18:16.210
<b>Strike Promotions</b>

18:14.670 --> 18:16.210
<b>Talent Division 2</b>

18:14.670 --> 18:16.210
<b> Management</b>

18:16.290 --> 18:17.500
Her manager, huh?

18:17.500 --> 18:18.830
A guy this stylish?

18:20.250 --> 18:21.670
You've got nice eyes.

18:22.830 --> 18:25.210
Nope! Nope, nope, nope! Definitely nope!

18:27.460 --> 18:29.420
I'll let you have just one macaron.

18:29.420 --> 18:30.920
No, I'm good.

18:31.250 --> 18:32.710
It's a junior high boy...

18:32.920 --> 18:34.750
Sure is...

18:35.080 --> 18:36.500
Got any girls you like?

18:37.250 --> 18:38.250
Otsuki!

18:38.250 --> 18:40.380
I want to revel in that youth!

18:40.790 --> 18:42.500
Niko Kouda is ready!

18:45.790 --> 18:47.250
Niko Kouda...?

18:47.580 --> 18:48.420
You don't know her?

18:48.420 --> 18:51.330
She's a cover model for CiEL and she's even on TV.

18:52.290 --> 18:54.380
What a striking face...

18:54.710 --> 19:00.540
Waaah! You won't believe it, Anna!
The taxi driver just kept ignoring me!

19:03.170 --> 19:05.580
You're so cool as always, Anna.

19:05.580 --> 19:06.670
Is she...?

19:09.000 --> 19:10.130
This your son?

19:10.130 --> 19:11.630
Do I look like a mom?

19:12.580 --> 19:14.960
Yes, yes, yes! Just like that.

19:15.750 --> 19:16.330
I really was imagining things.

19:16.330 --> 19:17.750
Now let's-
I really was imagining things.<b></b>

19:18.040 --> 19:22.830
No one would see me and Yamada like
that just because we were side by side.

19:22.830 --> 19:24.420
Can't wait to go home?

19:24.420 --> 19:26.040
N-no...

19:27.040 --> 19:29.500
You've got a massive inferiority complex.

19:29.500 --> 19:30.750
I mean...

19:31.580 --> 19:36.500
I've been working with her four years now...
I'm like her guardian.

19:36.500 --> 19:39.080
And no one's as honest as that girl.

19:39.380 --> 19:41.290
She tells me everything.

19:41.290 --> 19:42.670
Even about you...

19:44.540 --> 19:49.000
You're her pride and joy, I'd say.

19:49.500 --> 19:50.130
Huh?

19:50.130 --> 19:53.500
But, she's reaching an important stage.

19:54.080 --> 19:59.380
You know how your relationship
will hinder her work, I imagine?

20:01.420 --> 20:03.290
Hmm? What?

20:03.290 --> 20:05.080
Hang on a second.

20:05.080 --> 20:06.000
What?

20:06.830 --> 20:10.330
We aren't going out or anything.

20:14.080 --> 20:17.920
Really? I swear I have an eye for these things.

20:17.920 --> 20:20.130
Is that what we really look like?

20:22.710 --> 20:23.790
Well, then.

20:25.080 --> 20:26.290
<b>I</b>

20:26.330 --> 20:29.790
I really... respect her.

20:30.830 --> 20:32.330
Anna, I mean...

20:33.380 --> 20:34.710
<b>Want to Know</b>

20:34.880 --> 20:36.790
More upfront than I expected.

20:37.290 --> 20:41.210
That's it. Since way back.

20:42.130 --> 20:43.790
Ever since that moment.

20:44.670 --> 20:47.630
<b>I Want to Know</b>

20:49.040 --> 20:51.710
I hate how much of a child I am.

20:51.710 --> 20:53.580
That's why it hurts.

20:53.920 --> 20:56.080
W-what did you think?

20:57.170 --> 20:58.170
Today, I mean.

20:59.000 --> 21:01.420
Quiet but intense.

21:01.420 --> 21:04.170
Surprised how many people are involved.

21:04.170 --> 21:06.630
No, not all that, I mean...

21:09.460 --> 21:11.420
Oh, that reminds me.

21:11.880 --> 21:14.380
Is this okay? Is it creepy?

21:15.960 --> 21:18.210
I snuck in a picture, too.

21:18.210 --> 21:21.330
If you're going to take one, take it when I look better!

21:21.330 --> 21:24.040
Why? You look so pretty.
